# Real Apache Basic Auth — blocks unauthenticated requests before any PHP
# in this directory ever runs (the same "gate before the handler" guarantee
# src/middleware.ts used to provide). Covers /admin/endorsements,
# /admin/endorsements/{id}, and /api/admin/* (all rewritten into this
# directory by ../../.htaccess).
#
# {{REPO_ROOT}} is substituted with the real absolute path by the "Bake
# server path" step in .github/workflows/deploy.yml on every deploy —
# AuthUserFile needs an absolute path and this repo's checkout location on
# the server isn't known at build time. Left as a literal placeholder here
# (harmless no-op) if this .htaccess is ever served without going through
# that step, e.g. `astro build` run standalone.
AuthType Basic
AuthName "BitcoinIs.Money admin"
AuthUserFile {{REPO_ROOT}}/.htpasswd
Require valid-user
